The ProgramData Fact's possible reds, each with its own message:
- keep-open not asked for every folder (asked below 7);
- keep-open refused, or a correction fired outside %SystemRoot% (kept below 7);
- parents moved (kept != still-old, with the list);
- named refusal: the tests root cannot be created, or CommonApplicationData is blank, unqualified or under the Windows folder.
None of these skip.
